A. Technical-Service Transaction Steps

	I. Queuing - Kafaka
		1. Listen for transactions response from Business-Service on a Kafka Topic
		2. For each transaction;
			i. Do some field validations
			ii. If pass, CONTINUE, otherwise return FAILURE: Validation Error
		3. Save the transaction in the DB table
		4. Prepare Tranasction Object
		5. From EUREKA Registry, call Transaction Processor Service
		
B. Technical-Service Transaction Respose
	1. Receive response from Transaction Processor Service
	2. Place the response back to Kafka topic
	3. On a different thread, save the transaction Statuses
	
	


		
		